Phase 2 Implementation: CLI Commands (start, stop, enhanced status) and Removal of watch
Summary:
- Implemented 'agy-sync start' supporting detached background daemon spawning and '-f, --foreground' mode.
- Implemented 'agy-sync stop' with graceful SIGTERM termination, timeout, and PID file cleanup.
